msgctxt "104_Akiyama"
msgid "Thank you. You were a big help."
msgstr "Gracias, has sido de mucha ayuda."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Scout
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "116_Scout"
msgid "That cutie sure was upset. Is she going to be all right?"
msgstr "Esa preciosura se enfadó muchísimo. ¿Seguro que estará bien?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "128_Akiyama"
msgid "Don't worry, she'll be just fine. Now, I'm not sure if this\\r\nqualifies as \"compensation,\" but how about a job at my\\r\nhostess club?"
msgstr "No te preocupes, estará bien. No estoy seguro de que esto\\r\ncuente como \"Compensación,\" ¿pero qué tal si trabajas para mi\\r\nclub de hostess?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=7
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P7
#. y4:msg_speaker=Scout
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "140_Scout"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "Uh, ¿y eso?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Akiyama"
msgid "All you're doing right now is making your boss mad, so why\\r\ndon't you come work at our place? We'll take care of you."
msgstr "Ahora mismo estás volviendo loco a tu jefe, ¿Así que por qué\\r\nno te vienes a nuestro club? Te cuidaremos más que tu jefe actual."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Scout"
msgid "I'd like that. But are you sure you don't mind? Is your\\r\nclub... a specialty club?"
msgstr "Me encantaría. ¿Pero seguro que no te arrepientes? ¿Tu club se...\\r\nespecializa en lo mío?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Akiyama"
msgid "No, it's not that. It's just that I'm thinking it could get\\r\nkinda boring if all our girls have the same slender figure.\\r\nMight be good to get a little variety going."
msgstr "No, para nada. Es solo que creo que es un\\r\nun poco aburrido que todas nuestras chicas tengan la misma figura.\\r\nPuede que esté bien dar un poco más de variedad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Akiyama"
msgid "Somebody with your taste will help bring in girls for men\\r\nwho want something different."
msgstr "Alguien con tus gustos podría ayudar a traer chicas\\r\npara hombres que buscan algo distinto."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Scout"
msgid "Well, I'll have no problem pulling in curvy girls. I can\\r\nguarantee you that!"
msgstr "Bueno, no tendré problema llevándote chicas curvilíneas. ¡Te lo\\r\nGarantizo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "212_Akiyama"
msgid "Excellent. Then, I'll see you at the club."
msgstr "Excelente. Entonces, te veré en el club."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=14
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P14
#. y4:msg_speaker=Scout
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=2
msgctxt "224_Scout"
msgid "Yes, sir. Thank you for the opportunity."
msgstr "Sí, señor. Muchas gracias por esta oportunidad."

#. y4:line_status=translated
#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=15
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P15
#. y4:msg_speaker=Akiyama
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "236_Akiyama"
msgid "Sure thing. Take care."
msgstr "De nada. Cuídate."

